<title>JAPAN: Mitsui Mining raises zinc price 6,000 yen.</title>
<headline>Mitsui Mining raises zinc price 6,000 yen.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-01-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mitsui Mining and Smelting Co said on Thursday it had raised its selling price for zinc by 6,000 yen to 176,000 yen per tonne, effective immediately.</p>
</text>
